{
  "slug": "html-semantico-moderno",
  "title": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "5736befe-fdc1-4005-abea-11ff411efda2",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 0,
      "data": {
        "title": "HTML voltou a ser estratégico"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "0db9b1d5-4584-4da0-8407-94eecb0c343f",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Durante a era peak-SPA, HTML virou \"div em cima de div\" gerada por framework. Em 2026, com a plataforma entregando "
              },
              {
                "text": "<dialog>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", popover API, invoker commands, :has(), view transitions e anchor positioning, HTML bem escrito resolve features que antes exigiam 50kb de JS. Dominar HTML moderno é alavanca: menos código, mais a11y, zero dependência. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "28414655-99c6-42fb-a409-9b74915c3e3d",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 1,
      "data": {
        "title": "Landmarks e heading hierarchy"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "8823612c-8acc-49c0-8c29-e2ee3fbd9de8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Leitor de tela navega por landmarks ("
              },
              {
                "text": "<header>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", "
              },
              {
                "text": "<nav>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", "
              },
              {
                "text": "<main>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", "
              },
              {
                "text": "<aside>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", "
              },
              {
                "text": "<footer>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ") e headings. Cada página tem exatamente um "
              },
              {
                "text": "<h1>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", e a hierarquia não pula níveis. "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ba59a704-c7c7-4ff7-8491-76db0bfa6685",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "html",
            "code": "<body>\n  <header>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Principal\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/\">Início</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <h1>Título da página (único na rota)</h1>\n    <article>\n      <h2>Seção</h2>\n      <h3>Subseção</h3>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside aria-label=\"Barra lateral\">...</aside>\n  <footer>...</footer>\n</body>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a423d8be-a02e-4d0f-8f1f-6a9527c1bf32",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 2,
      "data": {
        "title": "Dialog nativo: o fim dos modais com bug"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "3260f8a0-d98f-44d0-a33b-00fbc6ae066f",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "html",
            "code": "<dialog id=\"confirmar\">\n  <form method=\"dialog\">\n    <h2>Confirmar exclusão?</h2>\n    <p>Essa ação não pode ser desfeita.</p>\n    <menu>\n      <button value=\"cancel\">Cancelar</button>\n      <button value=\"confirm\" autofocus>Excluir</button>\n    </menu>\n  </form>\n</dialog>\n\n<button onclick=\"document.getElementById('confirmar').showModal()\">\n  Excluir conta\n</button>\n\n<script>\n  const dlg = document.getElementById('confirmar');\n  dlg.addEventListener('close', () => {\n    if (dlg.returnValue === 'confirm') doDelete();\n  });\n</script>"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "9c34ebe4-35df-4dda-b2b2-c177cfed9936",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "showModal() aplica inert ao resto da página automaticamente, faz focus trap e fecha com Escape. method=\"dialog\" dentro do form fecha o dialog retornando o value do botão clicado."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3cd290f2-e23e-41a8-bb35-d3d50ce9b626",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 3,
      "data": {
        "title": "Popover API: menus e tooltips sem JS pesado"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e0e9db6a-737e-400a-a957-7b119ce8228e",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "html",
            "code": "<button popovertarget=\"menu-user\">Minha conta</button>\n\n<div id=\"menu-user\" popover>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"/perfil\">Perfil</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/preferencias\">Preferências</a></li>\n    <li><button popovertarget=\"menu-user\" popovertargetaction=\"hide\">\n      Sair do menu\n    </button></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Anchor positioning (Chrome 125+) para posicionar relativo ao botão -->\n<style>\n  #menu-user { position-anchor: --btn; top: anchor(bottom); }\n</style>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "db61a005-d2c8-418e-9382-cdaa9de369cc",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 4,
      "data": {
        "title": "Details/summary: acordeão sem JS"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "91b9ce29-3c26-41aa-aa37-d1ef5e6fc638",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "html",
            "code": "<details>\n  <summary>Qual a política de reembolso?</summary>\n  <p>Até 7 dias após a compra...</p>\n</details>\n\n<details name=\"faq\">\n  <summary>Pergunta A</summary>\n  <p>Resposta A</p>\n</details>\n<details name=\"faq\">\n  <summary>Pergunta B</summary>\n  <p>Resposta B</p>\n</details>\n<!-- name=\"faq\" torna o grupo exclusivo (abrir um fecha os outros) -->"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b9870d3d-71a0-4f0a-97d6-09a65f112dea",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 5,
      "data": {
        "title": "Form constraints nativos + CSS moderno"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "28a98c61-6645-451a-9fd1-401c45937b53",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "html",
            "code": "<form>\n  <label>\n    Email\n    <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\" />\n  </label>\n\n  <label>\n    Senha\n    <input type=\"password\" name=\"senha\" required minlength=\"8\"\n           pattern=\"^(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*\\d).+$\"\n           title=\"Ao menos 1 maiúscula e 1 número\" />\n  </label>\n\n  <button type=\"submit\">Entrar</button>\n</form>\n\n<style>\n  /* :user-invalid só depois de interação — evita vermelho antes de digitar */\n  input:user-invalid { border-color: crimson; }\n  input:user-valid { border-color: seagreen; }\n</style>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "618f824a-4665-47f7-ba01-6d095a4f7f76",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 6,
      "data": {
        "title": "Invoker commands (2024+): declarativo de verdade"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "6788e384-dad4-42ae-a628-562bb95e57d2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Proposta recém-estabilizada (Chrome 130+) que permite botões invocarem comandos em elementos alvo sem JS. Ideal para toggles simples. "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "26e652d2-0ced-44a9-adc1-d74b1e2bbdcd",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "html",
            "code": "<button command=\"show-modal\" commandfor=\"dlg\">Abrir</button>\n<button command=\"close\" commandfor=\"dlg\">Fechar</button>\n\n<dialog id=\"dlg\">\n  <p>Conteúdo</p>\n</dialog>\n\n<!-- Com fallback JS para browsers antigos -->\n<script>\n  if (!HTMLButtonElement.prototype.hasOwnProperty('command')) {\n    // polyfill simples\n    document.querySelectorAll('[command]').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const target = document.getElementById(btn.getAttribute('commandfor'));\n        if (btn.getAttribute('command') === 'show-modal') target.showModal();\n        if (btn.getAttribute('command') === 'close') target.close();\n      });\n    });\n  }\n</script>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a454a82c-ff48-4f3c-9e36-8ffb66fcbd49",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 7,
      "data": {
        "title": "Atributos esquecidos que valem ouro"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "49fed9be-934f-47a5-98c9-88730f748407",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "html",
            "code": "<!-- loading lazy em imagens fora do fold -->\n<img src=\"grafico.png\" alt=\"...\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n\n<!-- fetchpriority pra hero image (LCP) -->\n<img src=\"hero.jpg\" alt=\"...\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n\n<!-- enterkeyhint define teclado mobile do botão submit -->\n<input type=\"search\" enterkeyhint=\"search\" />\n\n<!-- inputmode otimiza teclado (numeric, decimal, tel, email, url) -->\n<input inputmode=\"decimal\" />\n\n<!-- spellcheck desliga em campos de código/username -->\n<input type=\"text\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocapitalize=\"off\" />"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7b8b2c22-2a91-4875-bb07-10e88ce52fb6",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 8,
      "data": {
        "title": "Fechamento"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "0241d90c-b192-475b-a170-7ac0abde48da",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "variant": "success",
            "title": "",
            "content": "HTML moderno resolve hoje o que exigia biblioteca ontem. <dialog>, popover, details com name, invoker commands e validação nativa substituem milhares de linhas de JS. Domine HTML antes de sair importando pacote de \"accessible modal\" — quase sempre o problema é código custom piorando o que a plataforma já faz."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}